# LeakSanitizer suppressions for known leaks.
#
# CTest passes this file to the tests in builds with
# WITH_COMPILER_ASAN=ON (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).  Remove an
# entry when its bug is fixed.  Suppressions match function names, so
# they need a symbolizer (llvm-symbolizer, or addr2line through
# ASAN_SYMBOLIZER_PATH, which CTest sets up when there is no
# llvm-symbolizer).

# Text widgets taking the MOTIF_DESTINATION selection: memory that libXt
# allocates in XtOwnSelection(), and in XtDisownSelection() when the
# widget is destroyed (Transfer.c, DisownCallback), is never freed.
# Seen with TextField (XmeSecondarySink), DataField (df_SetDestination)
# and the SelectionBox family through their TextField.  Not yet known
# whether libXt or the way Motif hands over the selection is at fault.
leak:XmeSecondarySink
leak:df_SetDestination
leak:DisownCallback

# Notebook.c, Destroy: frees the scroll frame data but not its navigator
# list (ScrollFrameT.c, _XmSFAddNavigator).
leak:_XmSFAddNavigator
